WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:14.910
24. Free-running. Running, urban, acrobatics, and tricks. Do those words seem to go together?

2
00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:20.690
If so, you may be a free-runner. Free-runners have taken tricks that are usually performed

3
00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:28.430
with a prop or at least a net and moved them into their daily lives and into public view.

4
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:34.070
Free-running is a way of interacting with the urban landscape in an unusual way. Free-runners

5
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:41.590
use the city as a gym. Instead of following the typical paths or doing typical movements,

6
00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:47.450
free-runners use urban obstacles as props for acrobatic tricks. Free-running is related

7
00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:54.630
to the French idea of parkour, but parkour is about efficiency, speed, and self-preservation,

8
00:00:54.630 --> 00:01:00.030
while free-running is more about fun. The free-running environment contains high and

9
00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:07.910
low walls, stairs, ramps, bars and fences, arches, and doorways. Therefore, most free-running

10
00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:13.110
moves are designed to use these elements. There are a variety of different vaults for

11
00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:18.690
getting over low walls. There are running techniques to help scale high walls and flips

12
00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:25.390
to get down off them. Dives, rolls, and twists help protect the body when landing. And of

13
00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:31.350
course, there are tons of ways to make each move more difficult, more athletic, and more

14
00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:37.550
pleasing to watch. All of these stunts are the reason free-running competitions are often

15
00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:43.790
held within larger, stunt competitions. There are more and more competitions dedicated solely

16
00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:49.550
to free-running, however. There are free-running clubs in many urban areas, and free-running

17
00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:55.650
fans are now active in many of the world's cities. If you see urban obstacles you can

18
00:01:55.650 --> 00:02:01.550
jump over, climb, or duck under, then there are probably free-runners in your city too.
